        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/united-states/south-carolina_slater-marietta"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The local mill plant produced the main material for the space suits used on the first Moon landing in 1969.",
