        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slater-Marietta%2C_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Slater Hall was built in 1920 as a community center for mill workers and remains a historic landmark in the area.",
